        <h2>Division of Radiological Health</h2>

    
    

</div>


    
    
    <div class="containers tn-accordion parbase">
    <div class="accordion" id="accordion-852ca078934c4f369a38ddabf65cd8cd">
        

        
            

            
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    

                    
                        <div class="accordion-heading">
                            <span class="accordion-title">
                                <button class="accordion-button icon-angle-right collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse-852ca078934c4f369a38ddabf65cd8cd-0" aria-controls="collapse-852ca078934c4f369a38ddabf65cd8cd-0" aria-expanded="false">
                                    Former American Nuclear Corporation (Oak Ridge, Anderson County)
                                </button>
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div id="collapse-852ca078934c4f369a38ddabf65cd8cd-0" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion-852ca078934c4f369a38ddabf65cd8cd">
                            <div class="accordion-body panel-body" tabindex="0">
                                <div>




    
    
    <div class="tn-textandimage textimage parbase">



<div class="textimage-left" style="float: left;">
<div  id="cq-image-jsp-/content/tn/environment/program-areas/rem-remediation/tnclean/jcr:content/content/tn_tabs_copy/parsys_east_tn_sites/tn_accordion_1203266884/parsys_former_american_nuclearcorporationoakridgeandersoncounty/tn_textandimage_copy/image"><a href="/content/dam/tn/environment/remediation/images/tn-clean/anc-images/rem_tnclean-anc_04-19-2023.JPG"><img src="/environment/program-areas/rem-remediation/tnclean/_jcr_content/content/tn_tabs_copy/parsys_east_tn_sites/tn_accordion_1203266884/parsys_former_american_nuclearcorporationoakridgeandersoncounty/tn_textandimage_copy/image.img.png/1755616982912.png" alt="anc-2023" title="anc-2023" class="cq-dd-image"></a></div>

    
<script type="text/javascript">
    (function() {
        var imageDiv = document.getElementById("cq\u002Dimage\u002Djsp\u002D\/content\/tn\/environment\/program\u002Dareas\/rem\u002Dremediation\/tnclean\/jcr:content\/content\/tn_tabs_copy\/parsys_east_tn_sites\/tn_accordion_1203266884\/parsys_former_american_nuclearcorporationoakridgeandersoncounty\/tn_textandimage_copy\/image");
        var imageEvars = '{ imageLink: "/content/dam/tn/environment/remediation/images/tn-clean/anc-images/rem_tnclean-anc_04-19-2023.JPG", imageAsset: "/content/dam/tn/environment/remediation/images/tn-clean/anc-images/rem_tnclean-anc_04-19-2023.JPG", imageTitle: "anc\u002D2023" }';
        var tagNodes = imageDiv.getElementsByTagName('A');
        for (var i = 0; i < tagNodes.length; i++) {
            var link = tagNodes.item(i); 
            link.setAttribute('onclick', 'CQ_Analytics.record({event: "imageClick", values: ' + imageEvars + ', collect: false, options: { obj: this }, componentPath: "tncore\/components\/content\/tn\u002Dimage"})');
        }
        
    })();
</script>


</div>
<div class="textimage-text">
    
        <p>The American Nuclear Corporation site, located in Clinton, TN, began operation in 1962. The facility was licensed by the Atomic Energy Commission to manufacture radiological sources for medical institutions. By 1972, after several years of operational issues and contamination events, the State took possession of the site in the mid to late 1980’s to prevent further misuse of the property.</p>
<p>Since 1993, Environmental Monitoring personnel with the Tennessee Division of Radiological Health (DRH) have monitored the site for any changes in detectable radioactivity or movement of radionuclides on or off the site due to environmental factors. During monthly visits to the site, survey readings are collected inside and outside the perimeter fence. During this monthly survey, a water sample is also collected from spring that leaves the ANC property. TDEC contacted EPA for assistance remediating the site in 2023 and remediation of the site was officially completed in 2025.</p>
<p>Learn more about the <a title="Division of Radiological Health" href="/content/tn/environment/radiation.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Division of Radiological Health</a>.<br />
</p>

    
    

</div>


